# Machine-specific REAPER config -- never sync these between the PC and the Mac.
# reaper.ini holds the audio device, plugin scan paths and MIDI device indices.
reaper.ini
reaper.ini.bak
REAPER.ini
# Keymap + custom actions + script registrations, all mixed into one file.
# Pulling this onto another machine silently overwrites that machine's keymap.
reaper-kb.ini
reaper-kb.ini.bak-*
# Per-machine state
reaper-*.log
reaper-recentfx.ini
reaper-hwoutfx.ini
reaper-defpresets.ini
reaper-fxoptions.ini
reaper-wndpos.ini
reaper-screensets.ini
reaper-extstate.ini
# Plugin caches -- regenerated on scan
reaper-vstplugins*.ini
reaper-clap*.ini
reaper-jsfx.ini
reaper-auplugins*.ini
plugin_cache*
# ReaPack's own state -- reinstall ReaPack per platform instead
ReaPack/
reapack.ini
UserPlugins/
*.dll
*.dylib
*.so
# Rendered audio -- keep the repo about the tools, not the output
*.wav
*.aiff
*.flac
*.mp3
*.ogg
Render/
render/
# Project files and their backups
*.rpp-bak
*.rpp-PROX
*.rpp-UNDO
*.reapeaks
# OS noise
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
